Element data attribution

The MIT license above covers the plugin's code. The element values in
ElementsData.js come from these sources, cited per field in that file's header:

- IUPAC/CIAAW Abridged Standard Atomic Weights 2024 (atomic weights)
- IUPAC Periodic Table of the Elements (groups and layout)
- PubChem Periodic Table, National Center for Biotechnology Information
  (category, electronegativity, van der Waals radius, melting and boiling
  points, oxidation states, configurations for Z >= 109)
- NIST Atomic Spectra Database (ground-state configurations, first
  ionization energies)
